# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Pawel Mazur
# Date: 2022-02-03
# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1543.002
# Description: Detects a creation of systemd services which could be used by adversaries to execute malicious code.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((type:"PATH" AND nametype:"CREATE") AND (((name:/usr/lib/systemd/system/* OR name:/etc/systemd/system/*)) OR (name:*/.config/systemd/user/*)))
